  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa, Zambia, Zimbabwe. In their proposed Access For All (A4A) project, the partnership wishes to work towards educational access and justice through both policy reform, and by transforming the way in which young people participate in shaping systems. Through the project, YETT seeks to integrate training on grassroots advocacy into their youth leadership development programme</narrative>
